- **Analysts are optimistic.** The bottom-up target price implies upside of 26.8% for IT, the largest of any sector, against 20.3% for the S&P 500. About 69% of ratings on IT stocks are Buy.
- **It is data rich.** Quarterly filings, estimate trackers, industry sales data and market prices are all freely available.

